WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:05.176
Turn off one gene in a human cell —
now predict the other eighteen thousand.

00:09.200 --> 00:15.488
We borrowed a catalog of real knockdowns
from one cell type, and tested it on one
it had never seen.

00:19.400 --> 00:24.440
Borrowed biology beat invented biology.
(Source: Replogle, genome-scale Perturb-seq)
